<script>
const P='file:///D:/Claude/';
const L=(t,p)=>'<a href="'+P+p+'" target=_blank>'+t+'</a> <code>D:\\Claude\\'+p.replace(/\//g,'\\')+'</code>';
const S=[
['1. Listen and decide (new this weekend)',[
 ['Name review pages (pick diacritics vs respelling per name). Start with 1 and 2, they cover the most frequent names. Press <b>Make code</b> at the bottom of each page and paste the text into chat. ~10 min per page.',
