 ['Polish voice: which clip sounds right and consistent? Plain (reference clip only) vs ultimate (reference + transcript). ~5 min.',[L('tone_pl_plain.mp3','Assets/Diary/lab/tone_out/tone_pl_plain.mp3'),L('tone_pl_ultimate.mp3','Assets/Diary/lab/tone_out/tone_pl_ultimate.mp3')]],
 ['English long video, new voice settings: tone consistent now? any odd sounds or head-motion glitches? Compare with the earlier long render. ~10 min.',[L('NEW ditto_ep03_long_en_v3_C.mp4','Assets/Diary/lab/video/ditto_ep03_long_en_v3_C.mp4'),L('audio only: ep03_long_en_v3.mp3','Assets/Diary/lab/tone_out/ep03_long_en_v3.mp3'),L('earlier: ditto_ep03_long_en_C.mp4','Assets/Diary/lab/video/ditto_ep03_long_en_C.mp4')]],
 ['Optional: earlier comparison material (tone variants v0-v3 are mp3 files in the same folder; names test with key).',[L('tone_out folder','Assets/Diary/lab/tone_out/'),L('names_test.mp3','Assets/Diary/lab/tone_out/names_test.mp3'),L('names_test_key.txt','Assets/Diary/lab/tone_out/names_test_key.txt')]]
]],
['2. Decisions needed from you',[
 ['Voice baseline for Polish and English (ultimate cloning = reference clip + its transcript looks best in English; Polish pending your ear).',[]],
 ['Avatar layout: Ditto gives a 512x512 full-face crop. Keep it in the feathered oval narrator layout, or use it larger? Does Ditto replace the mouth-only lip animation entirely? Compare the old approach on the same Polish audio:',[L('lipanim_pl_voxcpm.mp4 (mouth-only)','Assets/Diary/lab/video/lipanim_pl_voxcpm.mp4'),L('ditto_pl_voxcpm_C_steps100.mp4 (Ditto C)','Assets/Diary/lab/video/ditto_pl_voxcpm_C_steps100.mp4'),L('ditto_en_voxcpm_C_steps100.mp4 (Ditto C, EN)','Assets/Diary/lab/video/ditto_en_voxcpm_C_steps100.mp4')]],
 ['Python environments: keep separate isolated environments (recommended) but move them and the model cache out of D:\\Claude to e.g. D:\\AI\\ (I recreate them with uv; nothing to back up). OK?',[]],
 ['Backup script now excludes lab model cache, environments and Ditto checkpoints (done, original saved as tools\\backup.ps1.2026-11-15.bak). Optional cleanup: the ~52 GB already copied to the NAS and brokkr could be deleted.',[]],
 ['Later: GPU purchase (decide after we see how the render queue looks).',[]]
]],
['3. Carry-over items from earlier this week',[
 ['Confirm the English sentence splits I made for three pages (p2-33, p2-48, p2-50).',[L('prep-EN-splits.md','Projects/Diary/Episodes/prep-EN-splits.md')]],
 ['Answer the Polish prep flags for Episodes 2-4 (blocks PL Ep2-4 audio).',[L('prep-PL-flags-ep2-4.md','Projects/Diary/Episodes/prep-PL-flags-ep2-4.md')]],
 ['Review pages for glitch tagging (keys A / W / P tag problems).',[L('Ep3 review','Assets/Diary/review/ep03/review.html'),L('Ep4 review','Assets/Diary/review/ep04/review.html'),L('Ep1 demo','Assets/Diary/review/ep01-demo/review.html')]],
 ['Still open: EN deepen confirmation (files in Assets\\Diary\\tts\\audition-en-deepen), blink v11 freeze, oval placement, period FX preset, newsreel and lexicon items.',[]]
]],
['4. Parked on purpose',[
 ['Notebook 2 OCR and the local-model comparison (after Notebook 1 videos and the next Fable window). Note is in the Hub task list.',[]],
 ['Notebook 1 scan vs typed page inventory (first step when OCR work resumes).',[]]
]],
['5. Reference',[
 ['Running log of every model test, timings and your listening notes.',[L('LAB-LOG.md','Projects/Diary/LAB-LOG.md')]],
 ['Old A/B pages (audio may not play inside the Claude viewer, should work in Chrome).',[L('ab_v2_pl_en.html','Assets/Diary/lab/ab/ab_v2_pl_en.html'),L('ab_v2_pl_stress60.html','Assets/Diary/lab/ab/ab_v2_pl_stress60.html')]]
]]];
let h='',n=0,st={};try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('jt')||'{}')}catch(e){}
S.forEach(sec=>{h+='<h2>'+sec[0]+'</h2><ul>';sec[1].forEach(it=>{const id='c'+(n++);h+='<li><label><input type=checkbox id='+id+(st[id]?' checked':'')+'>'+it[0]+'</label>'+(it[1].length?'<div class=s>'+it[1].join('<br>')+'</div>':'')+'</li>'});h+='</ul>'});
document.getElementById('app').innerHTML=h;
document.getElementById('app').addEventListener('change',e=>{st[e.target.id]=e.target.checked;try{localStorage.setItem('jt',JSON.stringify(st))}catch(x){}});
